Uniform flats tables: not under the OpenMarch application's license

The lookup tables (lut/), layout.json and regions.json in this folder are
generated by scripts from the om-pose reference bodies in ../om-pose/bodies.
They are derived from those meshes, so they take the same terms:
the counsel gate (ADR 0010 D-7 and D-21). When the om-pose meshes take
CC0 1.0, these files do too.

The sample/ folder is OpenMarch-made artwork drawn on these outlines. Until
the owner decides whether art drawn on them can be CC0 1.0, it takes the same
terms as this folder: the counsel gate.
